    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilaghiro ja Isuwirio",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA, uo Mlungu wa Israeli waghamba huwu, “Wandu waawuyaghamba kukaia muzi ughu ghuchangirwa mikonunyi kwa mzuri wa Babuloni kwa chia ya wuda na njala, na saka izamie: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olenyi nichawitumbanya awo wandu kufuma kwa agho masanga nerewiwingieghe kwa wundu ghwa machu ghapo na kubia kwapo, na makai mabaa; nipate kuwiwunja andu aha, nani nichawibonya wikaie nicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawo wichawuya wandu wapo, nani nichakaia Mlungu wawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nichawineka nia imweri na chia imweri, wipate kuniobua kwa kala na kala kwa mecha ghawo na gha wana wawo wichaanugha nyuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani nichabonya ilaghano ja kala na kala nawo, kukaia sichaaleka kuwibonyera mecha. Nichawibonya winiobuo wisechewuya nyuma na kunisigha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nichaboilwa kuwibonyera mecha, nani nichawimangisha andenyi ya iji isanga, kwa ngolo yapo yose na kwa roho yapo yose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na sa iji koni nerewiredieghe wandu awa mawiwi, huwo koni nichawireia mecha ghose agho nerewilaghirieghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isanga iji mwawuyajighamba wei jeeka iduu, jisewadie mndungi hata nyamandu, jinekelo Wababuloni, jichaghaluka hata mbuwa rikaie rikighulwa aha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuwa richaghulwa kwa pesa, na barua reghua richangirwa sahihi, naro richakabwa muhuri na kushuhudilwa andenyi ya isanga ja Benjamini, na andu kose kuko kaavui na Jerusalemu, na andenyi ya mizi ya Juda, na mizi ya isanga ja mighondinyi, andenyi ya mizi ya Shefela, na mizi ya Negebu; kwa kukaia nichawiwunja sena isangenyi kwawo, ini BWANA naghamba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
